attempted insertions are gated.\end{proof}
\begin{remark}This is an \emph{integrity isolation} result, not a
liveness or availability guarantee. A faulty federation can still
consume resources or starve useful work if scheduling and budgets
allow it.\end{remark}

\chapter{Controller-aware quotients and search}
\section{Why a history quotient can break Player-0}

